---
// Visible marker on agent-drafted copy that a human has not approved yet. It
// uses the [TK: ...] form, so the pre-launch placeholder check catches it.
---

<p class="draft-marker">[TK: draft copy, needs human approval]</p>

<style>
  .draft-marker {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-block: 0 var(--space-4);
    padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-2);
    border: var(--border-width) dashed var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }
</style>
